CtrlLib/CtrlLib.h: CtrlLib/CtrlLib.h is the umbrella header for U++’s control library, exposing its GUI controls and shared initialization support for building application interfaces.
CtrlLib/LabelBase.h: LabelBase.h defines shared label drawing and control helpers for CtrlLib, including text measurement, access-key handling, focus and drop indicators, disabled images, label colors, and active-edge framing.
CtrlLib/DisplayPopup.h: `CtrlLib/DisplayPopup.h` declares `DisplayPopup`, a CtrlLib popup control for showing display-rendered content, typically alongside an editor or other control.
CtrlLib/PushCtrl.h: CtrlLib/PushCtrl.h declares U++ button and action controls, including push buttons, options, switches, data pushers, spin buttons, and virtual buttons, along with their styles and related behavior.
CtrlLib/EditCtrl.h: CtrlLib/EditCtrl.h defines U++’s editable controls, including EditField and typed value editors for strings, numbers, dates, and times. It also provides styles, input highlighting, validation, and spin-button support.
CtrlLib/TextEdit.h: CtrlLib/TextEdit.h declares U++ text-editing controls: the multiline `TextCtrl`, single-line `LineEdit`, and paragraph-oriented `DocEdit`, with support for editing state, undo, syntax highlighting, whitespace display, and line-ending options.
CtrlLib/ScrollBar.h: CtrlLib/ScrollBar.h declares U++ scrollbar controls, including horizontal and vertical bars, size grips, combined scrollbars, and scrollers. It provides styles and button-part identifiers for navigation and scrolling.
CtrlLib/HeaderCtrl.h: Defines `Upp::HeaderCtrl`, a configurable header control for tabular and list views. It manages columns, sizing and resizing, ordering, scrolling, and header interactions, with styles for layout behavior.
CtrlLib/ArrayCtrl.h: ArrayCtrl.h declares U++’s configurable table/list control, with column and row ordering, sorting, per-cell controls and displays, drag-and-drop support, and options for customizing array-style data views.
CtrlLib/MultiButton.h: Defines `Upp::MultiButton`, a composite button control with a main action and configurable subbuttons. Includes styling, layout, tips, image and margin options, and a frame helper for embedding it in other controls.
CtrlLib/DropChoice.h: `DropChoice.h` defines controls for editable or selectable drop-down choices, including popup tables and lists, `DropList`, and the `WithDropChoice` helper. It provides the declarations and interfaces used to present and manage dropdown options in CtrlLib.
CtrlLib/StaticCtrl.h: CtrlLib/StaticCtrl.h declares lightweight display controls, including static text and labels, label boxes, colored rectangles, image and drawing views, display-based controls, separators, and the ParentCtrl container.
CtrlLib/Splitter.h: CtrlLib/Splitter.h declares U++ splitter controls for dividing a layout into resizable panes. It provides orientation and style options, splitter frames, and APIs for managing pane sizes and positions.
CtrlLib/SliderCtrl.h: CtrlLib/SliderCtrl.h defines `SliderCtrl`, a CtrlLib widget for selecting a value by moving a slider. It exposes the control’s public interface; implementation is in `CtrlLib/SliderCtrl.cpp`.
CtrlLib/ColumnList.h: ColumnList.h declares a CtrlLib control for displaying and navigating items in list, column, or row-based layouts. It provides item ordering and presentation options for arranging content across columns.
CtrlLib/Progress.h: Defines CtrlLib progress controls: `ProgressIndicator` provides a configurable visual indicator, while `Progress` offers a higher-level interface for reporting and displaying task progress.
CtrlLib/AKeys.h: Defines CtrlLib’s keyboard shortcut infrastructure: key-binding metadata, key-description parsing and formatting, matching, and APIs for registering, storing, and restoring application and editor key maps.
CtrlLib/key_source.h: CtrlLib/key_source.h is a macro-driven key-binding generator: it includes a configured KEYFILE to define key metadata, then registers each binding at initialization. Optional macros set the key namespace and group name.
CtrlLib/RichText.h: CtrlLib/RichText.h provides GUI controls for viewing and interacting with rich text, plus HelpWindow and prompt/message-dialog APIs for common confirmations, alerts, errors, and customizable button options.
CtrlLib/DateTimeCtrl.h: Defines reusable date and time UI controls, including calendar and clock widgets, popup date/time selectors, and `DateTimeCtrl`, with styling and date/time mode support.
CtrlLib/SuggestCtrl.h: `SuggestCtrl` extends `EditString` with a dropdown of suggestions drawn from a configurable wide-string list. It supports adding and clearing entries, setting dropdown size, delimiter and comparison filters, and restricting matches to the start of input.
CtrlLib/Bar.h: CtrlLib/Bar.h defines U++ menu and toolbar infrastructure: bar items and panes, menu bars, tool buttons and toolbars, keyboard scanning, status-area helpers, and tooltips for building command-driven UI.
CtrlLib/MenuImp.h: CtrlLib/MenuImp.h defines the menu-item framework: base and concrete menu items, submenu types, styles and states for checks, radio buttons, highlighting, and push behavior, plus menu timing and control declarations.
CtrlLib/StatusBar.h: CtrlLib/StatusBar.h declares status-bar and information-display controls, including tabbed status panes, styling and top-frame support, plus progress display helpers for reporting task progress.
CtrlLib/TabCtrl.h: `TabCtrl` provides a styled, scrollable tab interface with selectable pages, labels, images, embedded controls, keyboard navigation, and change events. `TabDlg` wraps it in a dialog with optional standard buttons.
CtrlLib/TreeCtrl.h: CtrlLib/TreeCtrl.h declares U++’s tree-view control, including node and item data, sorting, and related option/drop-tree controls. It provides the API for displaying and managing hierarchical items in GUI applications.
CtrlLib/DlgColor.h: CtrlLib/DlgColor.h declares color-selection UI controls, including wheel and ramp pickers, a color popup, and color pusher/button widgets. It also exposes helpers for formatting, reading, and realizing colors.
CtrlLib/FileSel.h: CtrlLib/FileSel.h declares U++’s file-selection controls and helpers, including file lists, the FileSel dialog, native-selection support, and APIs for opening/saving files or choosing directories.
CtrlLib/CtrlUtil.h: CtrlLib/CtrlUtil.h declares reusable CtrlLib helpers for editing and control lookup, animations, hints, file-selection buttons, printing, tray and update utilities, and drawing support.
CtrlLib/Lang.h: `LNGCtrl` is a `StaticRect`-based language selector with two `DropList` controls. It exposes selected language through `GetData`/`SetData`, computes its minimum size, and forwards focus settings to both lists.
CtrlLib/Ch.h: Declares CtrlLib’s Chameleon skin presets and helpers for rounded shapes, button and scrollbar imagery, color analysis, synthetic styles and tabs, plus optional debug sampling.
